SUMMARY:Study Day 7: Statistics & A/B Testing
DESCRIPTION:Cover descriptive statistics, hypothesis testing, A/B testing, and funnel analysis. Solve 3 practice questions.\n\nTopics:\n- Descriptive statistics: mean, median, mode, std, variance\n- Hypothesis testing: null and alternative hypotheses\n- A/B testing: two-proportion z-test\n- Funnel analysis: conversion rates between steps\n- Data profiling and outlier detection\n\nPractice Problems:\n1. A/B Test with Hypothesis Testing\n2. Descriptive Statistics & Data Profiling\n3. Funnel Analysis (SQL + Python)\n\nResources:\n- Khan Academy Statistics\n- StatQuest A/B Testing\n- Evan Miller Sample Size for A/B Tests
